  "translation": "Sapos yu no salim ⟨את⟩ ol man bilong mi go, lukim, mi salim ⟨את⟩ ol arov — ol kain kain binatang i kamap olgeta — long yu, na long ol wokman bilong yu, na long ol man bilong yu, na long ol haus bilong yu; na ol haus bilong ol man Mitsrayim bai pulimap ⟨wantaim⟩ ol arov, na graun tu we ol i stap long en.",
